# 🔤✨ THE ART OF TYPOGRAPHY 🎨

Typography was selected to balance elegance with readability.

## Display Typeface

The main display typography is used for the **PRSTN** brand name and large headings. Its refined and decorative appearance helps communicate the premium floral identity.

## Supporting Typography

Bold and clean fonts are used for emphasis and important information.

## Poppins

Poppins is used as a modern and readable typeface for supporting text and details.

## Why This Combination?

The typography system combines personality and functionality. Decorative fonts establish the brand identity, while cleaner fonts make information easier to read.
